            "description": "<p>Step into the hoop and bring it up to the level of your waist. Spin the hoop around your waist in the direction that feels most comfortable for you. If you’re a right-handed person, you may be more comfortable spinning the hoop in a counter-clockwise motion. If you’re a left-handed person, try spinning the hoop clockwise.</p>",
