            "title": "<h3>3. Move Your Hips, Back and Stomach</h3>",
            "description": "<p>The hoop will move across your stomach. As this happens, push your stomach forward. Next, the hoop will move across your waist and to your back. Thrust your back out to meet the hoop, then push your stomach forward again. After a while, you’ll get a sense for how the rhythm of the hoop is affected by your body. Before this happens, the hoop may fall to the ground once or twice. That’s alright! Just keep going.</p>",
