            "title": "<h3>Neck Hula Hoop</h3>",
            "description": "<p>The hula hoop can be swung around the neck if you follow these suggestions. </p><ol><li>Start the hoop by spinning it around your neck in the same way you would start spinning your hoop around your waist.</li><li>Keep the hoop low on your neck, below your Adams’ apple. Avoid the tender areas beneath your chin and jaw. </li><li>Shift your weight from one leg to the other to keep the hoop rotating around your neck. </li></ol>",
